henticated PR author cannot approve their own PR.\\\\n\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-09-07T22:46:16Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"87451b53960ceabe88a01c44c287fee7f9ebf386\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOTa4DZM8AAAABMiHYQQ\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"ivanopcode\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"MEMBER\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Producer composition review for exact head 018c9d9672767fd02f42fb4ab4f2dfe3800646b8. Source: accepted sibling BUG-260908-7c5iv4 checkpoint dc68c158 and diagnostic CR-BUG-260908-33iyb1-2 candidate d6c87338, accepted by independent reviewer RUN-260908-353271. All 13 non-composed paths match the accepted candidate exactly; README additions merged cleanly, LOGBOOK retains both histories, existing PR validation fixture correction retained. All three introduced commits verify with Ivan Oparin identity; prior PR commits remain ancestors. Diagnostic baseline passes 3 tests; all 3 narrowing mutants are killed, including exit1-only admission. GitHub diff endpoint returned HTTP 406 (>300 files); paginated hosted path list was checked against exact local base-to-head diff. Independent combined-head review is PENDING; this comment is not approval. Hosted CI is pending; original hosted root-cause/green requirement BUG-260908-shki8p remains open. Remote main was not advanced. Prior real macOS evidence is reused for unchanged accepted scope, not represented as a build of this new commit.\\\\n\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-09-08T00:12:23Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"018c9d9672767fd02f42fb4ab4f2dfe3800646b8\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOTa4DZM8AAAABMiKC-A\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"ivanopcode\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"MEMBER\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Independent composition review: ACCEPT exact head 018c9d9672767fd02f42fb4ab4f2dfe3800646b8. DO NOT LAND: hosted CI is failing.\\\\n\\\\nIndependently checked PR head, advertised remote feature branch, clean delivery checkout, and fetched/advertised main b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74. All 408 paginated hosted files and all 408 hosted blob SHAs match the exact local diff/tree. All three introduced commits (6e8a1988, 87451b53, 018c9d96) verify with Ivan Oparin / oparin@me.com signing key; original signed PR ancestry is unchanged.\\\\n\\\\nThe complete old-head-to-new-head delta is exactly the 16 accepted CI paths. Fourteen blobs, including the validation fixture, equal accepted immutable d6c873383db09c59cf5d6d437e0767615e5ae704. README and LOGBOOK retain every old line and every accepted addition. The fixture retains the prior dependency correction and adds only diagnostic runners relative to old PR. All other Shared Runtime bytes are unchanged; prior independent Shared Runtime review is reused, not represented as a fresh broad audit.\\\\n\\\\nPersonally reran from the exact clean delivery head: 32 board/scanner/diagnostic Python tests (exit 0); actual board CLI (412 elements, exit 0); PR boundary mutation harness (exit 0, three expected failing mutant children); diagnostics mutation harness (exit 0, three expected failing mutant children); composition diff whitespace check (exit 0). Swift SnapshotDiff baseline and HTTP-admission negative compile through the shipped scratch harness on macOS/Swift 6.3.2. No full Xcode/application build or Go suite rerun. This is not proof of normally assembled build artifacts.\\\\n\\\\nNegative coverage: board root-only exclusion via actual CLI; scanner arbitrary-URL admission via runtime scanner; SnapshotDiff.compare rejects four non-file schemes at three URL positions before I/O. validate-macos-targets.sh -> run_logged_command drives five build/test positions for each of statuses 1 and 65 (10/10 injected rows; 5/7 Xcode sites); two build-settings failure paths and arbitrary other statuses are not exhaustively tested. The fifth exit-1 case alone is masked by a later missing-product exit; the named test kills admission through its earlier positions. No broad lexical/dataflow or complete diagnostic-tail boundary claim.\\\\n\\\\nCI run 34172537905 at this exact head is completed FAILURE: six jobs succeeded; generated project credential-free validation failed, macos-target-builds-and-contracts exit 65 / SwiftCompile nonzero. The visible tail does not establish the compiler root cause. Local green tests do not override this repository gate. BUG-260908-shki8p remains unresolved; no root-cause fix, hosted green, external-CI waiver, or landing authorization is claimed. Prior full local build evidence is accepted only with its documented initial HEV/SSH failures and later successful retry, not as determinism proof.\\\\n\\\\nCOMMENTED is intentional because the authenticated human account is the PR author. This independent ACCEPT is scoped to signed composition, not overall merge readiness. No source changes, commits, landing, VPN actions, or successors.\\\\n\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-09-08T00:19:55Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"018c9d9672767fd02f42fb4ab4f2dfe3800646b8\\\"}}]}\\n===COMMIT-VERIFY===\\n{\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"message\\\":null,\\\"tree\\\":{\\\"sha\\\":\\\"a46e2ba351a81e42f2907805b4cda2c313af7bd1\\\"}},\\\"sha\\\":\\\"a46e2ba351a81e42f2907805b4cda2c313af7bd1\\\",\\\"verification\\\":null}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 7886,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1972,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
